- (c) any order which has been made against the defendant in respect of the offence (or any of the offences) concerned under Schedule 6 to the Criminal Law Act 1981 (compensation orders).

- (10) But in applying subsection (7)(b) the court must not have regard to an order falling within subsection (9)(c) if a court has made a direction under section 73(6).

- (11) In deciding under this section whether one amount exceeds another, the court must take account of any change in the value of money.

